sequenceDiagram
participant A as Edge Application
participant D as Edge Device
participant E as Edge Management System
participant K as Kafka-Compatible Data Distribution Service
participant U as Utility Data-Lake Adapter
participant V as Application Vendor Adapter

Note over A,E: Application data reaches the EMS
A->>D: Send GEISA application message
D-->>E: Send application message via ADM /3600

Note over E,K: Data Distribution publication
E->>K: Publish GEISA data record (Kafka Produce)

Note over K,V: Independent logical consumers
U->>K: Continuously consume Utility topic
K-->>U: Return GEISA data record when available
U->>K: Commit Utility consumer position

V->>K: Continuously consume Application Vendor topic
K-->>V: Return same GEISA data record when available
V->>K: Commit Application Vendor consumer position

Note over U,V: Consumption or commit by one consumer does not affect the other
